Using Convex SDK 1.44.0, `defineTable` and `v` are imported from `convex/server` and `convex/values` respectively. The following fields are fixed.

```ts
const messages = defineTable({
  content: v.string(), author_email: v.string(), sent_at: v.number(),
});
```

A query uses `.withIndex("lookup", q => q.eq("author_email", email).gte("sent_at", start).lt("sent_at", end))` for one author and a time interval.
